{"sentence": "It shall specify its territorial and sectoral application and, where applicable, identify the supervisory authority or authorities referred to in point (b) of paragraph 2.", "label": "supported", "rationale": "This sentence reflects Article 45(3) requirements on specifying territorial/sectoral scope and identifying supervisory authorities.", "excerpt": "The implementing act shall specify its territorial and sectoral application and, where applicable, identify the supervisory authority or authorities referred to in point (b) of paragraph 2 of this Article."}
